!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = tissue: Hepatocellular Carcinoma
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: none
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = OCT-embedded tissue blocks were sectioned at 10 μm thickness using Cryostar NX70 (Leica) and tumoral tissues containing RNA with a RIN ≥ 6.8 were included in the Visium experiments. One section per patient was cut at 10 μm thickness and placed on Visium slide capture areas (10x Genomics). Slides were then processed following the 10x Genomics Visium Spatial protocol according to the manufacturer recommendations. The slides containing tissues were methanol-fixed at -20°C and processed for H&E staining and imaging.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Spatial transcriptome sequencing libraries were prepared with 10xGenomics Visium Spatail Gene Expression Slides & Reagent kit according to manufacturer's construction
!Sample_data_processing = Fastq raw sequencing data were processed using the 10x Genomics Space Ranger v1.3.0 pipeline with options indicated in supplementary file "Info_Supp_for_Visium.tsv"
!Sample_data_processing = Sequences were aligned to human GRCh38-2020 reference genome to gene expression count using Space Ranger's default settings
!Sample_data_processing = Gene expression level of Refseq coding genes were quantified using Space Ranger's default settings
!Sample_data_processing = Downstream analyses were performed using Seurat software
!Sample_data_processing = Assembly: GRCh38
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: aligned_fiducials.jpg.gz:  aligned fiducials of the tissue image
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: detected_tissue_image.jpg.gz:  image of tissue and spots
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: scalefactors_json.json.gz:  scalefactors in json format
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: tissue_hires_image.png.gz:  hi-res image of tissue
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: tissue_lowres_image.png.gz:  low-res image of tissue
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: tissue_positions_list.csv.gz:  list of spatial barcodes and the coordinates specifying spots
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: filtered_feature_bc_matrix.h5 : filtered feature file output from CellRanger, contains matrix, features and barcodes information
!Sample_data_processing = Library strategy: Spatial Transcriptomics
